# Amber: Journeys Beyond, start to the end of Margaret's chapter.
#
#   amber walk extract --replay full.walk
#   amber play extract --replay full.walk --mute
#
# No room is named: every line is a click or a move a player could make, so
# every film plays where a player would see it. The two exceptions are marked
# where they happen, and both are places where the shipped data has no click
# that would do the job -- see WORKLOG 145.
# 
# Act one: up from the boathouse, the breaker, the PeeK unit, the BAR
# manual, the videotape, the BAR itself, and the package on the porch.
# Amber: Journeys Beyond, played from the opening film through the first act,
# without jumping to a single room by name. Every line below is a move or a
# click a player could make, so the films play where a player would see them.
#
# It ends holding the oscillator, with the BAR running and the PeeK unit
# having reported it. What comes after -- the telephone, the headgear, the
# portal -- is behind seeing all six camera haunts, which happen on their own
# clock as the house is explored and so cannot be written down as a route.
#
#   amber play extract --replay margaret.walk --mute
#
# Up the hill from the boathouse to Roxy's front door.
down
forward
right
forward
forward
forward
forward
right
forward
forward
# Open the door. Without the power on, the house inside is dark.
pointer
forward
# Along the hall, up the stairs to the office, and pull the breaker.
forward
forward
left
left
forward
forward
forward
forward
examine
pointer
# Up the circular stairs to the loft.
browse
forward
forward
examine
# Take the PeeK unit; the next click stows it.
pointer
# Taking it opens it. Give it five seconds to slide up and say its piece --
# the window honours the beat and the terminal steps over it -- then the
# first click dismisses the readout and the second puts it back in the bag.
# Until it is back, the item in hand covers every exit in the room.
wait 300
click 320 200
click 320 200
# Back down to the writing desk.
browse
left
forward
forward
click 472 298
click 395 326
# Open the top drawer, open the BAR manual, turn two pages.
click 320 160
click 320 200
click 320 200
click 450 200
click 450 200
# The computer table and the videotape.
browse
left
forward
click 565 321
click 187 250
# One click lifts it, the second takes it.
click 300 200
click 300 200
# Downstairs to the living room, and the BAR.
pointer
right
forward
click 306 205
right
forward
click 477 265
forward
forward
right
click 444 303
click 316 244
examine
