# 
# The living room is the fourth station, and it comes on the air when a
# clock in the house reads seven. Nothing in the shipped data can move a
# clock -- `moveClock` is complete and has no caller anywhere on either
# disc -- so this is the second and last thing the walk does by hand.
# WORKLOG 145 has the whole chain.
